00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.033
You all have voting clickers
at your seats?

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:20.067
Do you all have them?
Alright, very good.

00:05:20.067 --> 00:05:21.467
Yep, they're green and red.

00:05:21.467 --> 00:05:23.334
Green is for go.
Red is for stop.

00:05:23.334 --> 00:05:24.667
You like, green, good.

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:26.234
Red, you don't like it.
It's fine.

00:05:26.234 --> 00:05:28.968
You can vote for all of them,
you can vote for none of them,

00:05:28.968 --> 00:05:30.667
whatever you want, and we're
gonna see the results live.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.300
Higgins, Roots,
you have clickers, too?

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.701
-Got it.
-Alright.

00:05:33.701 --> 00:05:35.868
Whatever tweet gets the most
likes, we will tweet it out live

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:38.234
on the show so
that you can all like it

00:05:38.234 --> 00:05:39.501
and WeTweet it.

00:05:39.501 --> 00:05:41.834
-Ah!
-It's like a shared experience.

00:05:41.834 --> 00:05:43.434
Alright, are you guys ready
for this?

00:05:43.434 --> 00:05:44.801
[ Crowd cheering ]
Alright.

00:05:44.801 --> 00:05:46.300
The first tweet is...

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.501
Wow. Alright, very good.
♪♪

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:54.501
I can already --
-Yeah.

00:05:54.501 --> 00:05:56.000
