Not gonna be good.

00:06:05.868 --> 00:06:07.968
Yeah, that's what I felt, yeah.
You didn't like that one.

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:09.734
Alright, no problem. No problem.

00:06:09.734 --> 00:06:11.434
I guess people
like FaceTiming people.

00:06:11.434 --> 00:06:14.133
-Yeah, they love it.
-Yeah. This next one says...

00:06:19.133 --> 00:06:20.334
