00:06:27.534 --> 00:06:28.968
Alright, let's see the results.

00:06:28.968 --> 00:06:30.234
I think this one
will be better than that one.

00:06:30.234 --> 00:06:31.701
Let's see.
Yeah, alright, a little bit.

00:06:31.701 --> 00:06:33.501
Not bad.
