The next one says...

00:06:47.267 --> 00:06:50.467
♪♪
-Wow! That got a groan.

00:06:50.467 --> 00:06:52.000
-Yeah, they liked that one.
-This one's gonna get high.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.100
-People enjoy -- Yeah.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.234
That one people enjoyed,
